{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Click and Tower</strong> is a strategic mix of tower defense, resource management, and long-term progression. Build and upgrade turrets to protect your town, collect resources, and survive waves of evolving enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you play, you\u2019ll unlock new tower types, discover rare resources, and expand your camp into a fortified base. Some upgrades carry over between runs, letting you start stronger each time and push further than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features include:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three distinct turret types with multiple upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A growing variety of enemy types and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resource gathering, research, and tech progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expanding your base with unlockable structures and systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Persistent unlocks that carry into future playthroughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rewarding gameplay loop focused on growth, strategy, and replayability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click to build, build to survive, survive to grow.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3175140?t=1744672314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744672314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175140/db816db39bdc24dc3a0cf04802e94a544d782651/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744672314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175140/db816db39bdc24dc3a0cf04802e94a544d782651/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744672314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{